<title>ITALY: BASKETBALL-OLYMPIAKOS WIN EUROPEAN TITLE.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-OLYMPIAKOS WIN EUROPEAN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympiakos won the men's European</p>
<p>club championship basketball title on Thursday when they beat</p>
<p>Barcelona 73-58 (halftime 31-29) in the final of the Final Four</p>
<p>tournament.</p>
</text>
